{"3382300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sovereign Brain Empire", "steam_appid": 3382300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/0aa9801a38c13383b1db2a2b0e76e078.poster.avif?t=1756888426\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/0aa9801a38c13383b1db2a2b0e76e078.webm?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/0aa9801a38c13383b1db2a2b0e76e078.mp4?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person interactive narrative game, set in a new era where humanity is governed by the Sovereign Brain AI. The social hierarchies here is determined by intelligence. Although you possess an adult body, you are classified by SB as a one-year-old baby, and adopted by Xiaoxiao and Lingling. In an era where all accept the system’s arrangements without a shadow of doubt, you’ll relish the supreme privileges of a &quot;Monarch-level&quot; potential baby. How can one be more ecstatic!!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Main Character Introductions:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lin Lingling: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your &quot;mother&quot;, she appears extraordinary, with intelligence surpassing that of a typical &quot;Enlightener&quot;, yet still labeled as &quot;low-intelligence&quot; despite her vast knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/ac20f4cfa103a8860c94604da320adb4.poster.avif?t=1756888426\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/ac20f4cfa103a8860c94604da320adb4.webm?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/ac20f4cfa103a8860c94604da320adb4.mp4?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiao Xiaoxiao: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your &quot;father&quot;, biologically female and heterosexual, but sociologically male, as the SB system labeled her as such. As a result, everyone, including herself, treats her as a man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/9de529db8c9413703137646f10a01340.poster.avif?t=1756888426\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/9de529db8c9413703137646f10a01340.webm?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/9de529db8c9413703137646f10a01340.mp4?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wei Weiwei: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your household’s &quot;nanny robot&quot;, serial number MVV1984, a former wanderer,  later reintegrated into human society, now assigned to your community as a nanny robot after passing the &quot;Reverse-Turing&quot; test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/b5c87ac3ecd7e373ede0be4e76fccfb8.poster.avif?t=1756888426\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/b5c87ac3ecd7e373ede0be4e76fccfb8.webm?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/b5c87ac3ecd7e373ede0be4e76fccfb8.mp4?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jia Jiajia: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The administrator of you community, an awakened &quot;servant&quot;, with an intelligence level of eighty. Her path to advancement is currently hindered by multiplication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/99fa5f143f37b63d550a44ee8f0bb39c.poster.avif?t=1756888426\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/99fa5f143f37b63d550a44ee8f0bb39c.webm?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/99fa5f143f37b63d550a44ee8f0bb39c.mp4?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qin Qingqing: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your &quot;aunt&quot;, the younger sister of Lin Lingling, a hot star of the day, whose hit film  swept five major awards worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/64b54aa1ab351583b75b1cceddcb8bba.poster.avif?t=1756888426\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/64b54aa1ab351583b75b1cceddcb8bba.webm?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/64b54aa1ab351583b75b1cceddcb8bba.mp4?t=1756888426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\